answers.body:
The problem is that your inner for loops is not in canonical shape. Therefore openmp fails to parallelize the loops and no speedup can be achieved. The loops need to look like the following picture. Where start, idx and inc are not allowed to be changed during the parallel part of the code. I think I identified your problem. You are calling these function: packWT(a, n, lb, s, jb, colNr, WT[ip], nr); packWT(a, n, lb, s, jb, colNr, WT[ip], nr);
