You cannot pass the variable 'i' to +:total[i] either you specify the array subsection to be reduced or just do +:total . Bear in mind, however, that you need a compiler that supports OpenMP 4.5 array reduction feature. #pragma omp simd collapse(2) reduction(+:total)
